# Shared by both images (apps/hub and apps/selfhost). Only source + lockfile are
# needed to build inside the image; everything else is rebuilt in-container or
# irrelevant to it. Note `.env` and `.env.*`: provider keys are supplied at run
# time and must never be baked into a layer.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
out
**/out
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.claude
_bmad
_bmad-output
# The parity harness is a CI gate, never part of a runtime image, and it holds
# the only code in the repo that imports both envelopes (Story 4.4).
parity
docs
*.md
.env
.env.*
